# Trained models are regenerated by train.py - usually not worth
# committing to git since .joblib files are large binary blobs and
# change every time you retrain. Uncomment the line below if your
# team decides differently (e.g. to guarantee everyone has the exact
# same model without needing to retrain).
# trained_models/*.joblib
